---
{
  title: "pendingp"
}
---
### NAME

    pendingp() - Determine whether a promise has yet to settle.

### SYNOPSIS

    int pendingp( promise p );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determine whether a promise has yet to settle.

### PARAMETERS

    p  (promise)
       The promise to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the promise is still pending, 0 if it has resolved, rejected,
    or was cancelled.
